            <trans-unit id="aiSuite.module.mcp.configClaudeDesktopBridgeHint">
                <source>Claude Desktop only launches local commands, so the connection runs through the mcp-remote bridge (requires Node.js). With a self-signed certificate (DDEV/mkcert) add "env": {"NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS": "&lt;mkcert -CAROOT&gt;/rootCA.pem"} to the entry, because Node.js does not use the operating system trust store. Alternatively add the server URL under Settings, Connectors, Add custom connector and authenticate via OAuth.</source>
